Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.03,0:01:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a warm welcome for Hermos?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.07,0:01:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not one of his cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.67,0:01:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I was given the eye of Timaeus,\NJoey was chosen to wield the claw of Hermos.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.09,0:01:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he act like Wheeler\Nget his hands on that card?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.13,0:01:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because he has the card\Ndoesn't mean he knows how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.21,0:01:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be the true test of his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.01,0:01:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get him out of here and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the main security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.75,0:01:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to figure out how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I found the secret to ending\Nthis duel and saving us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.47,0:01:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And it all starts with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So first, I'll bring\Nback Fiend Mega-Cyber!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.99,0:02:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To refresh your memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My Harpy's pet dragon\Ndisintegrated your puny fiend once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and she'll do it again\Nwithout even flinching!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.85,0:02:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.87,0:02:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say I was done?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I plan to reacquaint you\Nwith my old friend, Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, here's Hermos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.25,0:02:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to your hairdo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.43,0:02:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'm gonna combine my hammos\Nand my time wizard together
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.35,0:02:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be huge, I can feel it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,good one I'm really shaking\Nin me boots I haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,seen a two monster that\Nscary in a long time Run,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a croquet hammer with wings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, what was he thinking playing\Nthat? Can he change that hammer thingy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,back into a dragon there's no need\Nto first impressions can be deceiving
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,who cares what it looks like\Ni'm gonna trust my deck and use
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.35,0:03:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,my new weapon now my fiend\Nmega cyber Pick up that hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.99,0:03:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, time to flatten your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Joey knows what he's doing\Nout there, right Tristan? I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,His monster's attack points are still lower\Nthan mine, but I have to play it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Harpy Lady Sparrow Formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.17,0:04:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fiend and his little\Nhammer are history!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That little hammer has all the power\Nof my dragon and my time wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all the numbers, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the wrong person to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the counting lesson, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do me a favor with your next\Nattack and teach me the alphabet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it? The alphabet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.49,0:04:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still trying to lose on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.35,0:05:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to prove I'm the better\Nduelist and you're quitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.21,0:05:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want to do right now\Nis get you out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It all ends here. Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My hornbees!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.53,0:05:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm as confused as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.39,0:05:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All her monsters disappeared at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been something Joey did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Joey's hammer was able to destroy\Nall of Mai's monsters somehow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The hole Joey created is still there,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,which could mean that Mai's\Nmonsters aren't gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They may return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to lose this duel, then fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.83,0:06:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.01,0:06:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't want to lose. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want either of us to lose, which\Nis why there's something I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.05,0:06:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now feed Mega-Cyber!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack her life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll forgive me.\NSomeday. No! Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get a soul no\Nmatter which one loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.61,0:06:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's one of us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also put one card\Nface down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to make sure our life\Npoints hit zero at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.31,0:06:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll both be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.13,0:06:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:06:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this to me! Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave up everything just to be a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll never lose. Hey, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.87,0:07:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,One of Mai's monsters just came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd she do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.81,0:07:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's hammer was\Ncreated from Time Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,so I have a feeling it didn't\Ndestroy Mai's monsters at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but rather sent them into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why didn't I think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one was transported forward in\Ntime by a different number of turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.23,0:07:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why all those numbers showed\Nup when Joey attacked with his hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Each number must have represented\Na future turn in the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means Mai's monsters won't\Nshow up until that turn starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.27,0:08:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for Joey, Harpy's pet\Ndragon had the number one above it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.47,0:08:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So it showed up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.65,0:08:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's worse, it's\NMai's turn to attack now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a tip, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time you play a\Ncard, know how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, there's not gonna be\Na next time for you, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy's pet dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy his fiend now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that if\NI were her. My weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal face-down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My skull dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.19,0:08:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dragon's about to\Nlose some attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find out how many\Nonce I roll the die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Skull Dice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A two!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That means your Hoppy's pet dragon\Nloses half of its attack points now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.51,0:09:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost even!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to win! My! You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Have to win. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.69,0:09:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Balan, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.99,0:09:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,With this fragment of the\NOricolco stone, I unlock the seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.83,0:09:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.19,0:09:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.19,0:09:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, Valon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You betrayed Master Darts\Nand risked your own soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.75,0:09:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And you mean to tell me you did all that\Njust so you could save some girl, Valon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.51,0:10:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not just some girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you listen to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.97,0:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make up for this by\Ntaking your soul, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.03,0:10:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,the power around my neck\Nput your puzzle to shame
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.69,0:10:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This should do it. Awesome, I cracked the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,security system hey\Nlook we're not locked in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Anymore but where did\Nthose creeps go, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,you okay man joey don't give up on us now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,joey where's my did those\Npunks take her guess
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so yeah she's gone huh\Noh no i was so close
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:11:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll get you back my
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I let them take Mai away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault. She's gone. I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.39,0:11:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She turned her back on all of\Nus and joined the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens to her\Nnow is her own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.61,0:11:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's got enough on his mind now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta face facts. Come on, you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.39,0:11:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mai wasn't just playing a friendly\Ngame of duel monsters out there, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She was after Joey's soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.57,0:11:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.71,0:11:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are all you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke's here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.53,0:11:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly not the dweeb convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.47,0:12:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Any sign of Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, my Valentine\Ngot to him before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.99,0:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She took his soul with\Nsome Orycalcos thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Orycalcos?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, have you experienced\Nthis card before? You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto just wiped the floor\Nwith someone who played it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He pretended to be Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.53,0:12:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and then made us fly all the way\Nto Dula's kingdom to duel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.69,0:12:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And then he ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So we came here to get some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever captured Pegasus is trying to take\Nover my company, and that's unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.79,0:12:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus said someone was after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.95,0:12:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're ruining the reputation of my game,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.59,0:12:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm afraid that's just\Nnot good for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The only catch is it's too risky to\Nleave you any information on this tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:13:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means you'll have\Nto come see me in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And last but not least, I've\Nenclosed a one-of-a-kind card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard it with your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.83,0:13:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They mustn't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This card Pegasus sent us may be a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.67,0:13:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to contain the image of a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There was one door upstairs that wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,unlock even when I cracked\Nthe security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Take us there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.15,0:13:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Who invited you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We were here first, you moocher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be all right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll rescue mine. Thanks, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think's up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll soon find out. What\Nare we, chopped liver?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you, you and I\Nget no respect at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.15,0:13:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If they ignore us, it'll be\Nthat much easier to sneak in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever's behind\Nthat door will be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How can anyone find their\Nway around this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the door, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just need to figure out how\Nto open it with a Duel Monsters card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.67,0:14:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone got any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.93,0:14:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.01,0:14:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So who wants to go in there first?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can all draw\Nstraws or something, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's close the door and run, Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.51,0:14:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.35,0:14:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird. Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'd say borderline creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate these toons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this visit quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.57,0:14:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus probably stashed\Nhis rarest cards in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and why are we standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:14:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:14:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.95,0:15:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi boy, at least I hope\Nit's you that found this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, if you couldn't tell, I\Ndid all the interior decorating myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty impressive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy has got to get over himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down. I can't hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.45,0:15:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're hearing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.33,0:15:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that can only mean the gentlemen who are
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,after my soul were finally\Nable to capture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So please listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It all began when a mysterious\Nman tried to buy out my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I got dragged into this whole mess because
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,someone is trying to\Nbuy out my company also.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.44,0:15:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.99,0:15:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This individual possesses an ancient\Npower stronger than any I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,His darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.83,0:15:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose darts?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts plans to use my game\Nto destroy civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.23,0:15:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:16:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And the key to taking him down\Nis somewhere in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since my retirement began,\NI've had a lot of time on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So I began to further my studies of the\Nancient Egyptian origins of dual monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I made an astonishing discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,These creatures existed long before\Nthe pyramids were even built.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In the city of Atlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is where this\NDart character comes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to resurrect the most\Nterrifying beast ever to roam the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,By draining the souls of\Nman and beast, in order to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.59,0:16:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,build up the strength of\Nthis unstoppable monster
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,of course The age of destruction is here\NThe earth shall be shrouded in darkness And
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,your very soul shall fuel the force that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.53,0:16:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,devastates mankind What\Ndo you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A great beast is now\Nawakening from its ancient
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:17:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,slumber To complete what\Nit began centuries ago No,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but before it can arise,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,it must feast upon enough souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If his plan works,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,darts will have succeeded in\Nunleashing a truly devastating power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.87,0:17:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the likes of which have not\Nbeen seen for 10,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope, so I've created an\Nexclusive card just for you, Yugi boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've hidden this one-of-a-kind\Ncard somewhere in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Think strategically now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.73,0:17:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can one find an extra card?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.37,0:17:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pot of greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In the game of duel monsters,\Nthat lets you draw extra cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.69,0:17:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, real special card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.35,0:17:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing's completely blank, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.17,0:17:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.83,0:18:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My cute little duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon they'll be gone, along\Nwith the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you can save the poor\Ncreatures that made my game famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, talk about drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man, this can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Mai join a plot\Nto destroy the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, they\Nbrainwashed her or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you all wake up? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All designed by Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.47,0:18:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one traveling around stealing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,people's souls with\Nsome magic playing card.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the same nonsense Pegasus\Npulled in Duelist Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.15,0:18:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to distract me long\Nenough for him to take over Kaivocorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.51,0:18:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You should wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not always about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something going on here that's\Nbigger than all of us, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Same place I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.01,0:19:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, you have one of\Nthese, too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.33,0:19:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're referring to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nothing magic going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the only way\Nto defeat this great
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.91,0:19:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Leviathan is to use these\Nthree cards together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.23,0:19:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So trust what's inside\Nyour heart and join us.
